{"3779750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medieval Lands", "steam_appid": 3779750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/7ff8458191da59a4b4113599a2d5c8f7.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/7ff8458191da59a4b4113599a2d5c8f7.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light of two moons shines down upon Oreneon, a land teetering on the edge of chaos. Rival kingdoms battle, twisted creatures threaten the land, and manipulative gods walk the earth - by inhabiting the forms of unwitting mortals. Will you uncover the truth behind the gods’ avatars? Confront the monstrous perversions threatening the land? Or forge your own legend in defiance of gods and mortals alike? The choice is yours…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/0d70c7955e9a56712664bb4cdb5d0336.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/0d70c7955e9a56712664bb4cdb5d0336.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a hand-drawn environment and a nostalgic feel, Medieval Lands is a classic fantasy MMORPG improved for contemporary players - whether you grew up playing games like this or are just starting out on your adventure. This is for everyone who loves old-school gaming, but wants a more accessible, polished experience. You’re welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/7ee1a50b0b3202df16fd52d2e3b41427.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/7ee1a50b0b3202df16fd52d2e3b41427.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Lands is free to play, with no pay-to-win content. At all. We know how frustrating it is to watch other players skip the grind by buying their way through. Annoying. Duel-inducing. We got you. Focus on the game, not on your coin pouch. There are more important things to worry about - like the actual joy of the quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/11bc6c9a659204ce7520db0a2fd5b677.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/11bc6c9a659204ce7520db0a2fd5b677.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your real-life buddies, or make some new friends from across the internet. Quest together, make guilds, and allow wild shenanigans to ensue. We know a friendly, healthy community is the heart of any good MMORPG. You can still choose to be a solo player if you prefer, although every adventure alongside your trusted companions is a special experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/4a68f88ad230dea7df696c4ea5d0df64.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/4a68f88ad230dea7df696c4ea5d0df64.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from among nine fantasy races: the classic humans, elves, half-orcs, and dwarves, as well as more obscure dragonkind and nymphs and even a few original and unique races you’ll only see in Oreneon - Avecian, Wampex, and Oni-inspired demonkind. Change up your looks, confirm your character, and enter the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/bf2508e9b44a13e7fa4f258e6944a0bb.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/bf2508e9b44a13e7fa4f258e6944a0bb.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever created a character and regretted choosing to be a wizard because you’ve realized you’re a stealthy one at heart? Good news for you: in Medieval Lands, you’re not locked into a specific class. Learn the skills you want and create your own unique mix of combat with melee, archery, magic, summoning, and more. Your fate is your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/7bdaaccb4f5742057e3acdf2cd39cee6.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/7bdaaccb4f5742057e3acdf2cd39cee6.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources from the world around you to make weapons, armor, essences, potions, and more. There’s just something special about wielding a sword you made yourself, you know? And always having a stash of homemade healing potions is certainly a wise move. You can even place your goods for sale in the market stalls and make yourself some coin. Possibilities abound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/af521ccc551be6cdfc3f721a6878383e.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/af521ccc551be6cdfc3f721a6878383e.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have unleashed yet more cruel punishment upon the land - twisting its once peaceful creatures into monstrous perversions. If you think a panther is already a terrifying creature, you’re not ready for a panther covered in giant eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/2750f2c3d7e8f67e36ed9153d362f9bc.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/2750f2c3d7e8f67e36ed9153d362f9bc.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero who deserves to wear the best of garb. Since Medieval Lands isn’t pay-to-win, the only in-game purchases are optional cosmetic items - clothing, mounts, etc. Venture through Oreneon looking like the epic adventurer you are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/c82e53f4e91734387ffe567d356fb4a1.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/c82e53f4e91734387ffe567d356fb4a1.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From towering cities to dark caves, from lush islands to arid deserts, from market squares to mysterious forests, there’s an entire world to discover. We all have those spots in games where we like to linger. Take your time wandering and roaming, and see what adventures await!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/7ff8458191da59a4b4113599a2d5c8f7.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/7ff8458191da59a4b4113599a2d5c8f7.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light of two moons shines down upon Oreneon, a land teetering on the edge of chaos. Rival kingdoms battle, twisted creatures threaten the land, and manipulative gods walk the earth - by inhabiting the forms of unwitting mortals. Will you uncover the truth behind the gods’ avatars? Confront the monstrous perversions threatening the land? Or forge your own legend in defiance of gods and mortals alike? The choice is yours…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/0d70c7955e9a56712664bb4cdb5d0336.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras_big/0d70c7955e9a56712664bb4cdb5d0336.webp?t=1785693988 width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a hand-drawn environment and a nostalgic feel, Medieval Lands is a classic fantasy MMORPG improved for contemporary players - whether you grew up playing games like this or are just starting out on your adventure. This is for everyone who loves old-school gaming, but wants a more accessible, polished experience. You’re welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/extras/7ee1a50b0b3202df16fd52d2e3b41427.avif?t=1785693988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_