es. Forge your own path in a classless gaming experience with a variety of skills, races, and playstyles. Explore the open world, slay mystical monsters, battle other players, amass riches, and more!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/58d5e9b182baf04393487eac73239db692065555/header.jpg?t=1785693988", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/4f5cb1d1b44778847b3dce278a627a5cd100f4ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785693988", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779750/4f5cb1d1b44778847b3dce278a627a5cd100f4ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785693988", "website": "https://medievallands.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires internet connection to play</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-12500H / any AMD Ryzen CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><